# Defense in depth for secrets and runtime state.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/config.ini
**/credentials.*
**/secrets.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.log
